{
  "metadata": { "name": "Volatility", "language_info": { "name": "JavaScipt", "version": "8.0" } },
  "jsnbversion": "v0.1",
  "cells": [
    { "code": "# Voltrix Tests — `/options/volatility`\n", "status": "", "output": "<h1>Voltrix Tests — <code>/options/volatility</code></h1>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "const BASE = 'http://localhost:8000/v2';\n\nasync function post(path, body) {\n  const res = await fetch(`${BASE}${path}`, {\n    method: 'POST',\n    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n    body: JSON.stringify(body),\n  });\n  return res.json();\n}", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 1. Implied Vol — Interactive\n\nEnter a market option price and recover the implied volatility.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>1. Implied Vol — Interactive</h2>\n<p>Enter a market option price and recover the implied volatility.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "//>html\n<div>\n  <label>Type <select id='iv-type'><option value='call'>call</option><option value='put'>put</option></select></label>\n  <label>Vol Model <select id='iv-model'><option value='log_normal'>log_normal (BS)</option><option value='normal'>normal (Bachelier)</option></select></label>\n  <label>Market Price <input id='iv-price' type='number' value='10.45' step='0.1'></label>\n  <label>Spot <input id='iv-spot' type='number' value='100'></label>\n  <label>Strike <input id='iv-strike' type='number' value='100'></label>\n  <label>Rate <input id='iv-rate' type='number' value='0.05' step='0.01'></label>\n  <label>Settlement Date <input id='iv-settle' type='date' value='2026-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Expiry Date <input id='iv-expiry' type='date' value='2027-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Initial Guess <input id='iv-guess' type='number' value='0.2' step='0.05'></label>\n</div>", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "const result = await post('/options/volatility', {\n  type:            'implied',\n  option_price:    parseFloat(document.getElementById('iv-price').value),\n  option_type:     document.getElementById('iv-type').value,\n  spot:            parseFloat(document.getElementById('iv-spot').value),\n  strike:          parseFloat(document.getElementById('iv-strike').value),\n  rate:            parseFloat(document.getElementById('iv-rate').value),\n  settlement_date: document.getElementById('iv-settle').value,\n  expiry_date:     document.getElementById('iv-expiry').value,\n  vol_type:        document.getElementById('iv-model').value,\n  initial_guess:   parseFloat(document.getElementById('iv-guess').value),\n  tolerance: 1e-7, max_iterations: 100,\n});\nscrib.show('Implied Vol: ' + result.volatility);\nscrib.show('Days to expiry: ' + result.time_to_expiry_days);\nscrib.show(result.convergence);\nscrib.show(result.insights);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 2. Round-Trip Check\n\nPrice at a known vol, then recover via implied vol. Recovered value should match input.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>2. Round-Trip Check</h2>\n<p>Price at a known vol, then recover via implied vol. Recovered value should match input.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "//>html\n<div>\n  <label>True σ <input id='rt-vol' type='number' value='0.25' step='0.01'></label>\n  <label>Spot <input id='rt-spot' type='number' value='100'></label>\n  <label>Strike <input id='rt-strike' type='number' value='100'></label>\n  <label>Settlement Date <input id='rt-settle' type='date' value='2026-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Expiry Date <input id='rt-expiry' type='date' value='2027-01-01'></label>\n</div>", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "const trueVol = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rt-vol').value);\nconst S       = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rt-spot').value);\nconst K       = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rt-strike').value);\nconst settle  = document.getElementById('rt-settle').value;\nconst expiry  = document.getElementById('rt-expiry').value;\n\nconst priced = await post('/options/price', {\n  model: 'black_scholes', option_type: 'call',\n  spot: S, strike: K, rate: 0.05,\n  settlement_date: settle, expiry_date: expiry,\n  volatility: trueVol,\n});\nconst recovered = await post('/options/volatility', {\n  type: 'implied', option_price: priced.price, option_type: 'call',\n  spot: S, strike: K, rate: 0.05,\n  settlement_date: settle, expiry_date: expiry,\n  vol_type: 'log_normal', initial_guess: trueVol * 1.5,\n});\nscrib.show('Input σ:     ' + trueVol);\nscrib.show('Price:       ' + priced.price);\nscrib.show('Recovered σ: ' + recovered.volatility);\nscrib.show('Error:       ' + Math.abs(recovered.volatility - trueVol).toExponential(3));\nscrib.show('Iterations:  ' + recovered.convergence.iterations);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 3. Implied Vol Smile Builder\n\nPrice calls at multiple strikes with flat vol, then recover IV at each.\nFlat input → flat smile (all IVs equal the input vol).\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>3. Implied Vol Smile Builder</h2>\n<p>Price calls at multiple strikes with flat vol, then recover IV at each. Flat input → flat smile.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "//>html\n<div>\n  <label>Flat σ <input id='sm-vol' type='number' value='0.2' step='0.01'></label>\n  <label>Spot <input id='sm-spot' type='number' value='100'></label>\n  <label>Settlement Date <input id='sm-settle' type='date' value='2026-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Expiry Date <input id='sm-expiry' type='date' value='2027-01-01'></label>\n</div>", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "const vol    = parseFloat(document.getElementById('sm-vol').value);\nconst spot   = parseFloat(document.getElementById('sm-spot').value);\nconst settle = document.getElementById('sm-settle').value;\nconst expiry = document.getElementById('sm-expiry').value;\n\nconst strikes = [80, 85, 90, 95, 100, 105, 110, 115, 120];\nconst prices = await Promise.all(strikes.map(K =>\n  post('/options/price', {\n    model: 'black_scholes', option_type: 'call',\n    spot, strike: K, rate: 0.05,\n    settlement_date: settle, expiry_date: expiry, volatility: vol,\n  })\n));\nconst ivs = await Promise.all(strikes.map((K, i) =>\n  post('/options/volatility', {\n    type: 'implied', option_price: prices[i].price, option_type: 'call',\n    spot, strike: K, rate: 0.05,\n    settlement_date: settle, expiry_date: expiry, vol_type: 'log_normal',\n  })\n));\nscrib.show('Strike | Price    | Implied σ');\nstrikes.forEach((K, i) =>\n  scrib.show('  ' + String(K).padStart(3) + '  | ' + prices[i].price.toFixed(5) + ' | ' + ivs[i].volatility.toFixed(6))\n);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 4. Historical Vol — Interactive\n\nEnter a comma-separated price series to compute annualised volatility.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>4. Historical Vol — Interactive</h2>\n<p>Enter a comma-separated price series to compute annualised volatility.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "//>html\n<div>\n  <label>Price Series (comma-separated)<br>\n    <input id='hv-prices' type='text' value='100,102,101,105,107,104,108,110,109,112' style='width:400px'>\n  </label>\n  <label>Method <select id='hv-method'><option value='log_returns'>log_returns</option><option value='simple_returns'>simple_returns</option></select></label>\n  <label>Ann. Factor <input id='hv-ann' type='number' value='252'></label>\n  <label>Window (blank = all) <input id='hv-window' type='text' value='' placeholder='all'></label>\n</div>", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "const raw    = document.getElementById('hv-prices').value;\nconst prices = raw.split(',').map(s => parseFloat(s.trim())).filter(n => !isNaN(n));\nconst win    = document.getElementById('hv-window').value.trim();\n\nconst result = await post('/options/volatility', {\n  type:                 'historical',\n  prices,\n  method:               document.getElementById('hv-method').value,\n  annualization_factor: parseInt(document.getElementById('hv-ann').value),\n  ...(win ? { window: parseInt(win) } : {}),\n});\nscrib.show('Prices used: ' + prices.length);\nscrib.show('Annualised Vol: ' + result.volatility);\nscrib.show(result.insights);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 5. Full vs Rolling Window Comparison\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>5. Full vs Rolling Window Comparison</h2>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "//>html\n<div>\n  <label>Window Size <input id='rw-win' type='number' value='5' min='2'></label>\n</div>", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "const prices = [100, 98, 102, 99, 103, 101, 105, 108, 106, 110, 115, 112];\nconst window = parseInt(document.getElementById('rw-win').value);\n\nconst [full, rolling] = await Promise.all([\n  post('/options/volatility', { type: 'historical', prices, method: 'log_returns', annualization_factor: 252 }),\n  post('/options/volatility', { type: 'historical', prices, method: 'log_returns', annualization_factor: 252, window }),\n]);\nscrib.show('Full series vol (' + (prices.length - 1) + ' returns): ' + full.volatility);\nscrib.show('Rolling ' + window + '-period vol: ' + rolling.volatility);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 6. Error — Price Below Intrinsic\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>6. Error — Price Below Intrinsic</h2>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "const result = await post('/options/volatility', {\n  type: 'implied', option_price: 0.001, option_type: 'call',\n  spot: 100, strike: 50, rate: 0.05,\n  settlement_date: '2026-01-01', expiry_date: '2027-01-01',\n  vol_type: 'log_normal',\n});\nscrib.show(result);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" }
  ],
  "source": "https://github.com/gopi-suvanam/scribbler",
  "run_on_load": false
}
